#. …そうだ！
#. 江ノ島盾子が<CLT 3>別人と入れ替わってた<CLT>としたら！？
msgctxt "0001 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"That's it! What if she <CLT 3>switched places with someone\n"
"else<CLT>!?"
msgstr ""

#. い、入れ替わるって…？
msgctxt "0002 | TOUKO FUKAWA"
msgid "S-Switched places...?"
msgstr ""

#. つまり、彼女は槍で貫かれて殺される前に、
#. 他の人と入れ替わっていたんだよ。
msgctxt "0003 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"That's right. Before the spears could kill her, she\n"
"got someone to take her place."
msgstr ""

#. …戦刃むくろとさ！
msgctxt "0004 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "Specifically, Mukuro Ikusaba!"
msgstr ""

#. それなら、後で再利用されたのも、
#. その戦刃むくろの死体という事になるはずだな…
msgctxt "0005 | BYAKUYA TOGAMI"
msgid ""
"Then that would make it Mukuro's corpse that showed up\n"
"later."
msgstr ""

#. その身体的特徴も、
#. 戦刃むくろのプロフィールと一致するはずだよね？
msgctxt "0006 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"Which is why the body's height and weight and\n"
"everything matched Mukuro's profile, right?"
msgstr ""

#. でも…入れ替わったっつってもよ…
msgctxt "0007 | YASUHIRO HAGAKURE"
msgid ""
"I dunno anything about this switching places thing,\n"
"but..."
msgstr ""

#. あの時、殺されたのって、
#. どう見ても江ノ島っちだったべ…？
msgctxt "0008 | YASUHIRO HAGAKURE"
msgid ""
"...that had to be Junko who got stabbed to death,\n"
"right?"
msgstr ""

#. そ、それに…入れ替わったって…
#. いつ、入れ替わったって言うの…？
msgctxt "0009 | TOUKO FUKAWA"
msgid ""
"Yeah, you're s-saying they switched? When could they\n"
"even h-have done that?"
msgstr ""

#. こ、殺される瞬間に…
#. 忍者ばりの変わり身の術でも…使ったって言うの…？
msgctxt "0010 | TOUKO FUKAWA"
msgid ""
"Right when she was a-about to die? Like she used some\n"
"kind of ninja r-replacement technique?"
msgstr ""

#. そっか…入れ替わるにしても…
#. その方法がないんだね…
msgctxt "0011 | AOI ASAHINA"
msgid ""
"Good point. There's just no way they could have\n"
"switched like that."
msgstr ""

#. じゃあ、やっぱ違うのかな…
msgctxt "0012 | AOI ASAHINA"
msgid "So maybe the whole idea is wrong..."
msgstr ""

#. 最初から入れ替わる
msgctxt "0013 | CHOICE/RE:ACT"
msgid "They switched at the beginning"
msgstr ""

#. 死んでから入れ替わる
msgctxt "0014 | CHOICE/RE:ACT"
msgid "They switched after death"
msgstr ""

#. し、死んでから…？
#. それってつまり…
msgctxt "0015 | YASUHIRO HAGAKURE"
msgid "After death? Are you saying...?"
msgstr ""

#. 憑依だべ…！！　幽霊だべ…！！
#. オカルトだべ…！！
msgctxt "0016 | YASUHIRO HAGAKURE"
msgid "She's possessed! It's a ghost! It's the Illuminati!"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>そういうつもりじゃなかったけど…
#. そういう事になるのか…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0017 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>That's...not really what I meant. But I guess there's\n"
"no other way to explain it.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>確かに…そうだよな…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0018 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>Yeah...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""
"<CLT 4>Phải...\n"
"<CLT>"

#. <CLT 4>みんなのボクに対する印象が、
#. 悪くなったみたいだ…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0019 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>Looks like I just embarrassed myself\n"
"in front of everyone...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""
"<CLT 4>Có vẻ như mình vừa mới làm trò hề trước mặt mọi\n"
"người rồi...\n"
"<CLT>"

#. 殺される瞬間に入れ替わる
msgctxt "0020 | CHOICE/RE:ACT"
msgid "They switched at the moment of death"
msgstr ""

#. 例えばさ…モノクマの中に隠れてて、
#. 槍が貫く直前に…とか…
msgctxt "0021 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"Like, you know...she was hiding inside Monokuma, and\n"
"then...just before the spears hit..."
msgstr ""

#. 俺らが解体したモノクマには、
#. そんな隙間はなかったべ…？
msgctxt "0022 | YASUHIRO HAGAKURE"
msgid ""
"But we opened up Monokuma, right? I don't think there\n"
"was enough room in there for a person..."
msgstr ""

#. どちらにしろ、あれだけの人間が見ている中、
#. 入れ替わるのは無理だろう。
msgctxt "0023 | BYAKUYA TOGAMI"
msgid ""
"Besides, we were all standing right there. How could\n"
"they have switched without us noticing?"
msgstr ""

#. そうだよね…さすがに気付くよね…
msgctxt "0024 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "Oh, yeah. We probably would have saw it, huh?"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>確かに…そうだよな…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0025 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>Yeah, for sure...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>みんなのボクに対する印象が、
#. 悪くなったみたいだ…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0026 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>Looks like I just embarrassed myself\n"
"in front of everyone...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""
"<CLT 4>Có vẻ như mình vừa mới làm trò hề trước mặt mọi\n"
"người rồi...\n"
"<CLT>"

#. うぷぷ…困ってる。
msgctxt "0027 | JUNKO ENOSHIMA (REAL)"
msgid "Puhuhu... You're lost, aren't you?"
msgstr ""

#. アーッハッハッハッハッハ！！
#. 困ってる困ってるッ！！
msgctxt "0028 | JUNKO ENOSHIMA (REAL)"
msgid ""
"Ahh-hahahaha! Lost like a tiny little dinghy on a\n"
"great big ocean!"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>誰も気付かない入れ替わり…
#. それが可能なのは、あの時だけだ…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0029 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>They only time they could have switched without any of\n"
"us knowing...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>みんなのボクに対する印象が、
#. 悪くなったみたいだ…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0030 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>Looks like I just embarrassed myself\n"
"in front of everyone...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""
"<CLT 4>Có vẻ như mình vừa mới làm trò hề trước mặt mọi\n"
"người rồi...\n"
"<CLT>"

#. <CLT 4>いや…方法はあるはずだ。
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0031 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>There has to be some way...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>それらの問題を一気に解決して、
#. ２人の入れ替わりを可能にする方法が…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0032 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>I need to figure out how to explain how they could\n"
"have switched...!\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""
